}," for any entry in ",{"tag":"code","children":["mValuePoolDeltas"]}," having ",{"tag":"code","children":["bundleType"]}," ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mo","children":["="]},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖭"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖬"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗎"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗇"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖽"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗅"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖽"]}]}]}," MUST be 0. That is, amounts to remove from circulation MUST be denominated in ZEC."]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["[NU7 onward] The value of ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗆"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖵"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖺"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗅"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗎"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖯"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗈"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗈"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗅"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖣"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗅"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗍"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖺"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗌"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":["["],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}},{"tag":"mo","children":["("],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖭"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖲"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖬"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖡"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗎"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗇"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖽"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗅"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖨"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖽"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":[","]},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖹"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖾"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖼"]}]},{"tag":"mo","children":[")"],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}},{"tag":"mo","children":["]"],"attrs":{"stretchy":"false"}}]},", if present, MUST be nonpositive. Its absolute value is ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗓"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗂"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗉"]},{"tag":"mn","children":["𝟤𝟥𝟥"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖺"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗆"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗈"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗎"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗇"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗍"]}]}]},"."]}]},{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["[NU7 onward] ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗓"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗂"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗉"]},{"tag":"mn","children":["𝟤𝟥𝟥"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖺"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗆"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗈"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗎"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗇"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗍"]}]}]}," does not result in an output being produced in any chain value pool."]}]}]}]},{"tag":"p","children":["In § 7.1 'Transaction Encoding and Consensus' ",{"tag":"sup","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["10"],"href":"#fn:protocol-txnconsensus"}],"id":"fnref:protocol-txnconsensus"},", add:"]},{"tag":"blockquote","children":[{"tag":"p","children":["[NU7 onward] ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗓"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗂"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗉"]},{"tag":"mn","children":["𝟤𝟥𝟥"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖺"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗆"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗈"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗎"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗇"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝗍"]}]}]}," MUST be in the range ",{"tag":"math","children":[{"tag":"mo","children":["{"]},{"tag":"mn","children":["0"]},{"tag":"mo","children":["."]},{"tag":"mo","children":["."]},{"tag":"mrow","children":[{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖬"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖠"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖷"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["_"]},{"tag":"mi","children":["𝖬"]},{"tag":"mi"